  "description": "In a village encircled by strange rumors of a certain estate, Yoon \"A,\" an average high school boy, is suddenly dumped with a single handwritten letter. As A retraces the clues his (ex)girlfriend left behind in order to discover the reasons behind her decision, he becomes closer to Shin \"B,\" the slightly gloomy and strange student librarian...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
